      "description": "DRAFT original antihero. Lanky bent-neck dragon with an angular underbite, tiny star pupils under unequal heavy eyelids, scuffed plum coat, dirty shirt and a crooked tie. Seven authored crooked mouth replacements; keyed pupils, cheeks, jaw, head, wings, tail, shoulder, elbow, wrist and finger. Authored three-quarter face.",
